<title>RUSSIA: Eight die in Russian military helicopter crash.</title>
<headline>Eight die in Russian military helicopter crash.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight servicemen died when a military transport helicopter crashed near the southern Russian town of Yeysk on Tuesday, an airforce spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman said that the Mi-8MT helicopter, which had a crew of three, was carrying five servicemen &quot;on a mission&quot;. He declined to give further details of the crash.</p>
</text>
